{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object. If reached, grab and process. If not, approach, check and move. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = IsObjectReached    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = PickupObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    />\"",
